{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Background</strong>: &quot;Escape from the Forest&quot; tells the story of a little boy who gets lost in a fantastical forest. You will play as this little boy, seeking the help of other people in the forest and fighting against the monsters within it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Genre</strong>: This game is a 2D pixel-style RPG. You will control the little boy to explore in this 2D forest and find a way to escape from it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong>: Defeat the monsters in the forest, help NPCs complete corresponding tasks, make different choices and attempts to achieve different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Endings</strong>: This game has multiple endings. Different decisions made by players will affect the game endings. <u>We encourage players to try multiple times to discover different endings.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Difficulty:</strong> The game has a certain level of difficulty. Once the character dies, all saved games will be cleared. Therefore, you need to allocate gold coins and resources rationally in order to achieve different endings.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I was in a bad state at that time.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649480/d28058fe7ad31a43f1f1f31b7b77cabad0de4e3a.jpg"},{"name":"Get lost.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649480/889e68c8ea652173bfa17ed4ffc3f456197c2b21.jpg"},{"name":"The protection of the statue.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649480/8ee8b6383e738f5264e167b9131295f7f6e28c0b.jpg"},{"name":"The help of the elf.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/app